      </blockquote>
      <p class="attribution">— Distributor partners, Middle East</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial">
      <blockquote>
        "South American importers value OEM customization speed — from drawing to approved
        sample, with brand and packaging built to spec."
      </blockquote>
      <p class="attribution">— Importer partners, South America</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:32px;">Who You Work With</h2>
    <p>
      DINWEYS is led on the commercial side by <strong>Martin Wong, Sales Director</strong> —
      14 years in battery manufacturing, from the production floor to export sales. Martin is
      the named point of contact for OEM, private-label and fleet programs, and the editor
      responsible for the technical guidance published on the
      <a href="https://docs.dinweysbattery.com/" style="color:#1e5aa8;">DINWEYS Knowledge Hub</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="data-note">
      Technical documentation is written and reviewed against manufacturer data sheets under
      an IATF 16949 quality management system.
    </p>

