      <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:0;">Explore DINWEYS</h2>
      <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;">
        <li><a href="https://docs.dinweysbattery.com/factory-manufacturing/" style="color:#1e5aa8;">How DINWEYS batteries are made &amp; tested (Knowledge Hub)</a></li>
