    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:40px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Is DINWEYS a factory or a trading company?</h3>
      <p>DINWEYS is the truck and heavy-duty starting battery brand of Chengguang Power Tech Co., Ltd., a manufacturer founded in 2002 in Jinzhou City, Hebei, China. Batteries are produced end-to-end on the company's own 18 automated assembly lines rather than assembled from outsourced parts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Where are DINWEYS batteries manufactured?</h3>
      <p>At the Chengguang Power Tech Co., Ltd. facility in Jinzhou City, Shijiazhuang, Hebei Province, China — a 200,000 m² plant with 18 automated assembly lines. The facility figures are stated by the manufacturer and are not third-party audited.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
