    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Does DINWEYS offer OEM and private-label production?</h3>
      <p>Yes. OEM and private-label supply are part of the product range; branding, packaging, documentation and batch test records are agreed per program. Tell us the group size, CCA and market, and we quote against your specification.</p>
