    </div>

    <p class="data-note">
      Every claim on this page is tracked in the <a href="/data/" style="color:#1e5aa8;">Evidence &amp; Data</a> ledger,
      including the two we have not yet verified (facility figures and certification documents).
    </p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
